### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Register a sensor
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "SH-000123",
  "name": "Serra 3 - sonda nord",
  "device_class": "sensor",
  "site": "Sezze"
}

### Same serial again -> 409 Conflict
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "SH-000123",
  "name": "Duplicate",
  "device_class": "sensor",
  "site": "Sezze"
}

### Invalid body -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "123",
  "device_class": "toaster"
}

### List only sensors, first page
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/list?device_class=sensor&offset=0&limit=10

### Unknown id -> 404 Not Found
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/7f0c1a8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
